note The default shape, derived from planned_tree: a Kept entry is a step, a Stopped one is a step recorded with its Stop so the report can name it, a Cut one is left out and recorded with its first reason, a Cycle is dropped. The root is never cut or stopped. The rules and their thresholds were chosen by scoring against the hand-written feature tours of this repo; the report names every symbol each rule touched so an agent can put one back.

