symbol hang
lines 0 49
hash 2b6de7b114daf748
note Hangs a list of tree entries in a tour: walks them in pre-order and keeps a stack of the StepId at each depth, so the step created at depth d becomes the parent of everything at depth d+1. A symbol that already has a step reuses it and adds no second one, which also means notes already written survive; only a step anchored at the symbol's first line counts as the symbol's step, so a step narrowed to a slice of it does not stop the whole symbol from being added. Returns each symbol with its step. promote and add_drafted_tour (the build-tour wizard's create) both hang through it.

